      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm running into something similar where older avatars take minutes to load, then it will timeout and fall back to the error avatar. If I keep trying eventually it might work, but I have to get lucky. This whole process can take upward of 5 minutes of waiting for the timeout and retrying and there's no guarantee it will ever work. \n\nThe solution is to always reupload the avatar, if I reupload it the avatar loads instantly but with 20+ avatars it's hard to always go back and reupload or sometimes not possible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
